  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Summary (2026-10-12)\n\n- The 256 transfer-matrix words ⟨0|t_{a₁}(θ₁−h)t₁(θ₂)^{k₂}t_{a₃}(θ₃−h)t₁(θ₄)^{k₄} are a basis (companion twist, generic θ; exact rank).\n- SoV expansions of BPS states (A: v, F: w, v·w = 0), # nonzero of 256:\n\n| BPS state | # nonzero |\n|---|---|\n| vacuum (and E_ij that only rescale it) | 1 |\n| F only, w ∈ e₁⊥ general (3 params) | 9 (a₁ = a₃ = 0, k₂, k₄ ≤ 2) |\n| F only, exp(κE₃₄) | 4 (k ≤ 1; not a product: F–F exchange term) |\n| F only, exp(κE₂₄) | 5 |\n| A only, exp(κE₁₂) | 13 (a ≤ 2, k ≤ 1) |\n| A only, v ∈ e₄⊥ general | 56 |\n| SU(2)×SU(2) sector | 37 |\n| torus C[G_cᵀ] | 134–236 |\n| generic | 256 |\n\n- Building blocks (single-site rotations, non-BPS): site 1 + κe₄ and site 2 + κe₃ are 2-term.\n- Open: closed forms of the F-only coefficients; which of these sparse BPS families map to the physical (diagonal-frame) 3-pt polarisations; dependence on θ (ABJM point needs θ_A − θ_F = 2h; SoV needs generic θ); two-block bras built from F-only blocks.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## At the ABJM point pair by pair: θ_{A,n} = θ_{F,n} + 2h, θ_{F,n} generic\n\nθ = (θ_{F,1}+2h, θ_{F,1}, θ_{F,2}+2h, θ_{F,2}), θ_{F,1} = −3/5, θ_{F,2} = −11/8 (Paul's suggestion). Rebuild the transfer matrices, check the rank of the 256 words, and redo the BPS expansion counts.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "th = {-3/5 + 2 hh, -3/5, -11/8 + 2 hh, -11/8};\nClearAll[tFull];\ntFull[0, v_] := IdentityMatrix[nn^LL, SparseArray];\ntFull[1, v_] := tFull[1, v] = transferD[lax1, v, G, 4];\ntFull[2, v_] := tFull[2, v] = g2[v] transferD[lax2, v, Gw[G], 6];\ntFull[3, v_] := tFull[3, v] = g3[v] transferD[lax3, v, Det[G] Transpose[Inverse[G]], 4];\nA1 = Table[vac . tFull[a, th[[1]] - hh], {a, 0, 3}];\nT2 = tFull[1, th[[2]]]; T3list = Table[tFull[a, th[[3]] - hh], {a, 0, 3}]; T4 = tFull[1, th[[4]]];\nM = sovRow /@ wordsIdx;\nrankM = MatrixRank[M];\nMinv = If[rankM == 256, Inverse[N[M, 60]], Null];\nabjmRows = If[rankM == 256, {\n    rowOf[\"vacuum\", vac][[1 ;; 2]],\n    {\"random BPS\", Length[support[With[{v = {1, -2, 3, 1}, r = {2, 1, -1, 3}}, bps[v, r - (v . r)/(v . v) v]]]]},\n    {\"F only, w ∈ e₁⊥ general\", Length[support[bps[UnitVector[4, 1], UnitVector[4, 4] + 2/7 UnitVector[4, 3] - 3/5 UnitVector[4, 2]]]]},\n    {\"F only, exp(κE₃₄)\", Length[support[bpsG[MatrixExp[37/100 E4[3, 4]]]]]},\n    {\"F only, exp(κE₂₄)\", Length[support[bpsG[MatrixExp[37/100 E4[2, 4]]]]]},\n    {\"A only, exp(κE₁₂)\", Length[support[bpsG[MatrixExp[37/100 E4[1, 2]]]]]},\n    {\"A only, v ∈ e₄⊥ general\", Length[support[bps[UnitVector[4, 1] + 2/7 UnitVector[4, 2] - 3/5 UnitVector[4, 3], UnitVector[4, 4]]]]},\n    {\"SU(2)×SU(2) sector\", Length[support[bps[UnitVector[4, 1] + 2/7 UnitVector[4, 2], UnitVector[4, 4] - 3/5 UnitVector[4, 3]]]]},\n    {\"torus 1 − κGᵀ\", Length[support[bpsG[IdentityMatrix[4] - 37/100 GT]]]}}, {}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"θ\", th}, {\"rank of the 256 SoV words (exact)\", rankM}}, abjmRows], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
