  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result:** with the full fused t_a the 256 words have rank **81** at this θ: at u = θ_A − h = θ_F + h the scalar factor g₃ of the F site in the same pair, (u−θ_F)(u−θ_F−h), vanishes, so t₃(θ_A − h) ≡ 0, and the F-site Lax degenerates to h(1−P). Use the **reduced** t̄₂, t̄₃ (no ∏g) in the words instead.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "tRed[0, v_] := IdentityMatrix[nn^LL, SparseArray];\ntRed[1, v_] := tFull[1, v];\ntRed[2, v_] := tRed[2, v] = transferD[lax2, v, Gw[G], 6];\ntRed[3, v_] := tRed[3, v] = transferD[lax3, v, Det[G] Transpose[Inverse[G]], 4];\nA1 = Table[vac . tRed[a, th[[1]] - hh], {a, 0, 3}];\nT3list = Table[tRed[a, th[[3]] - hh], {a, 0, 3}];\nM = sovRow /@ wordsIdx;\nrankM = MatrixRank[M];\nMinv = If[rankM == 256, Inverse[N[M, 60]], Null];\nabjmRows = If[rankM == 256, {\n    {\"vacuum\", Length[support[vac]]},\n    {\"random BPS\", Length[support[With[{v = {1, -2, 3, 1}, r = {2, 1, -1, 3}}, bps[v, r - (v . r)/(v . v) v]]]]},\n    {\"F only, w ∈ e₁⊥ general\", Length[support[bps[UnitVector[4, 1], UnitVector[4, 4] + 2/7 UnitVector[4, 3] - 3/5 UnitVector[4, 2]]]]},\n    {\"F only, exp(κE₃₄)\", Length[support[bpsG[MatrixExp[37/100 E4[3, 4]]]]]},\n    {\"F only, exp(κE₂₄)\", Length[support[bpsG[MatrixExp[37/100 E4[2, 4]]]]]},\n    {\"A only, exp(κE₁₂)\", Length[support[bpsG[MatrixExp[37/100 E4[1, 2]]]]]},\n    {\"A only, v ∈ e₄⊥ general\", Length[support[bps[UnitVector[4, 1] + 2/7 UnitVector[4, 2] - 3/5 UnitVector[4, 3], UnitVector[4, 4]]]]},\n    {\"SU(2)×SU(2) sector\", Length[support[bps[UnitVector[4, 1] + 2/7 UnitVector[4, 2], UnitVector[4, 4] - 3/5 UnitVector[4, 3]]]]},\n    {\"torus 1 − κGᵀ\", Length[support[bpsG[IdentityMatrix[4] - 37/100 GT]]]}}, {}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"θ\", th}, {\"rank of the 256 reduced-t words (exact)\", rankM}}, abjmRows], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"87\" data-out-n=\"866\" data-sub-idx=\"10\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"13\" data-sub-start=\"19\" data-sub-end=\"19\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[866]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FycmF5fXt8Y3xjfH1caGxpbmVcdGhldGEgICYgXGxlZnRce1xmcmFjezJ9ezV9LC1cZnJhY3szfXs1fSwtXGZyYWN7M317OH0sLVxmcmFjezExfXs4fVxyaWdodFx9XFxcaGxpbmVcdGV4dHtyYW5rIG9mIHRoZSAyNTYgcmVkdWNlZC10IHdvcmRzIChleGFjdCl9ICYgMTY5XFxcaGxpbmVcZW5ke2FycmF5fQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.45em;vertical-align:-0.955em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.495em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.455em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.455em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.41em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.955em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.455em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.605em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.405em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rank of the 256 reduced-t words (exact)</span></