  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result:** with reduced t's the rank is **169 = 13²**: each A–F pair contributes only 13 independent words. Not a prefactor artefact: at u = θ_A − h = θ_F + h the same-pair F Lax is h(1−P), rank-deficient. Scan the evaluation point u_A of the A-site words (F words t₁(θ_F)^k kept).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "rankForShift[sh_] := Module[{a1, t3l, MM},\n   a1 = Table[vac . tRed[a, th[[1]] + sh], {a, 0, 3}]; t3l = Table[tRed[a, th[[3]] + sh], {a, 0, 3}];\n   MM = Table[Module[{v = a1[[w[[1]] + 1]]}, Do[v = v . T2, {w[[2]]}]; v = v . t3l[[w[[3]] + 1]]; Do[v = v . T4, {w[[4]]}]; v], {w, wordsIdx}];\n   MatrixRank[MM]];\nshiftRows = Table[{\"u_A = θ_A + (\" <> ToString[sh] <> \")\", rankForShift[sh]}, {sh, {0, hh, -hh, -2 hh, -3 hh, 2 hh}}];\nGrid[Prepend[shiftRows, {\"A-site evaluation point\", \"rank of 256 words (θ_A = θ_F + 2h, reduced t's)\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
