  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result:** at θ_A = θ_F + 2h the words are a basis for u_A = θ_A − 3h (= θ_F − h) and u_A = θ_A + 2h (= θ_F + 4h) (rank 256); u_A = θ_A, θ_A ± h, θ_A − 2h give 169. BPS expansion counts with both working choices:",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "countsFor[sh_] := Module[{},\n   A1 = Table[vac . tRed[a, th[[1]] + sh], {a, 0, 3}]; T3list = Table[tRed[a, th[[3]] + sh], {a, 0, 3}];\n   M = sovRow /@ wordsIdx; Minv = Inverse[N[M, 60]];\n   {MatrixRank[M], Length[support[vac]],\n    Length[support[With[{v = {1, -2, 3, 1}, r = {2, 1, -1, 3}}, bps[v, r - (v . r)/(v . v) v]]]],\n    Length[support[bps[UnitVector[4, 1], UnitVector[4, 4] + 2/7 UnitVector[4, 3] - 3/5 UnitVector[4, 2]]]],\n    Length[support[bpsG[MatrixExp[37/100 E4[3, 4]]]]], Length[support[bpsG[MatrixExp[37/100 E4[2, 4]]]]],\n    Length[support[bpsG[MatrixExp[37/100 E4[1, 2]]]]], Length[support[bpsG[MatrixExp[37/100 E4[1, 3]]]]],\n    Length[support[bps[UnitVector[4, 1] + 2/7 UnitVector[4, 2] - 3/5 UnitVector[4, 3], UnitVector[4, 4]]]],\n    Length[support[bps[UnitVector[4, 1] + 2/7 UnitVector[4, 2], UnitVector[4, 4] - 3/5 UnitVector[4, 3]]]],\n    Length[support[bpsG[IdentityMatrix[4] - 37/100 GT]]]}];\nlabelsC = {\"rank\", \"vacuum\", \"random BPS\", \"F only general\", \"F only E₃₄\", \"F only E₂₄\", \"A only E₁₂\", \"A only E₁₃\", \"A only general\", \"SU(2)×SU(2)\", \"torus 1−κGᵀ\"};\ncountsABJM = Table[countsFor[sh], {sh, {-3 hh, 2 hh}}];\nGrid[Prepend[Transpose[Prepend[countsABJM, labelsC]], {\"\", \"u_A = θ_A − 3h\", \"u_A = θ_A + 2h\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
