h:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-13.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-14.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-15.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-16.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[873]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline & \\text{u\\_A = $\\theta$\\_A − 3h} & \\text{u\\_A = $\\theta$\\_A + 2h}\\\\\\hline\\text{rank} & 256 & 256\\\\\\hline\\text{vacuum} & 1 & 1\\\\\\hline\\text{random BPS} & 256 & 256\\\\\\hline\\text{F only general} & 9 & 9\\\\\\hline\\text{F only E₃₄} & 4 & 4\\\\\\hline\\text{F only E₂₄} & 5 & 5\\\\\\hline\\text{A only E₁₂} & 13 & 13\\\\\\hline\\text{A only E₁₃} & 33 & 33\\\\\\hline\\text{A only general} & 56 & 56\\\\\\hline\\text{SU(2)$\\times$SU(2)} & 37 & 37\\\\\\hline\\text{torus 1−$\\kappa$Gᵀ} & 150 & 158\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "dc5dbae4-eb44-49e8-85ce-d8f6cc7fce92"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result (ABJM point pair by pair, θ_A = θ_F + 2h, θ_F generic):** the word basis survives if the A-site words are evaluated at u_A = θ_A − 3h or θ_A + 2h (reduced t̄₂, t̄₃; the full fused t₃ vanishes at θ_A − h through g₃). The usual point u_A = θ_A − h (and θ_A, θ_A + h, θ_A − 2h) gives rank 169 = 13² — the same-pair F Lax is h(1−P) there. BPS sparsity is unchanged: vacuum 1, F only general 9, E₃₄ 4, E₂₄ 5, E₁₂ 13, E₁₃ 33, A only general 56, SU(2)×SU(2) 37, random 256 (torus 150/158).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Do the word bases diagonalise B?\n\nRyan–Volin B-operator for gl(4) (eq. (2.27), as in `L2-ffbar-SoV-localisation-spec.md`), from the **untwisted** monodromy T:\n\nB(u) = Σ_{k₁∈{1,2,3}} Σ_{K₂⊂{1,2,3},|K₂|=2} T_{k₁,1}(u) qmin_{K₂;(1,k₁+1)}(u+h) qmin_{(1,2,3);(1,K₂+1)}(u+2h)\n\n(qmin_{rows;cols}: rows antisymmetrised, column k at v−(k−1)h, columns in the order written). Exact test for every word b: rank{b, b·B(u)} = 1 at u = 37/100 and −113/100; plus [B(u), B(v)] = 0. Cases: (i) generic θ, u_A = θ_A − h; (ii) θ_A = θ_F + 2h, u_A = θ_A − 3h; (iii) same θ, u_A = θ_A + 2h.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "setTheta[thNew_] := (th = thNew; ClearAll[tFull, tRed, Tun];\n   tFull[1, v_] := tFull[1, v] = transferD[lax1, v, G, 4];\n   tRed[0, v_] := IdentityMatrix[nn^LL, SparseArray]; tRed[1, v_] := tFull[1, v];\n   tRed[2, v_] := tRed[2, v] = transferD[lax2, v, Gw[G], 6]; tRed[3, v_] := tRed[3, v] = transferD[lax3, v, Det[G] Transpose[Inverse[G]], 4];\n   Tun[v_] := Tun[v] = monoD[lax1, v, 4]);\nqminU[rows_, cols_, v_] := Sum[Signature[p] Dot @@ Table[Tun[v - (k - 1) hh][[rows[[p[[k]]]], cols[[k]]]], {k, Length[cols]}], {p, Permutations[Range[Length[rows]]]}];\nBop[v_] := Sum[Tun[v][[k1, 1]] . qminU[K2, {1, k1 + 1}, v + hh] . qminU[{1, 2, 3}, Join[{1}, K2 + 1], v + 2 hh], {k1, 1, 3}, {K2, Subsets[{1, 2, 3}, {2}]}];\nwordBasis[sh_] := Module[{a1 = Table[vac . tRed[a, th[[1]] + sh], {a, 0, 3}], t2 = tRed[1, th[[2]]], t3l = Table[tRed[a, th[[3]] + sh], {a, 0, 3}], t4 = tRed[1, th[[4]]]},\n   Table[Module[{v = a1[[w[[1]] + 1]]}, Do[v = v . t2, {w[[2]]}]; v = v . t3l[[w[[3]] + 1]]; Do[v = v . t4, {w[[4]]}]; v], {w, wordsIdx}]];\nbTest[thNew_, sh_] := Module[{MM, B1, B2, eig},\n   setTheta[thNew]; MM = wordBasis[sh]; B1 = Bop[37/100]; B2 = Bop[-113/100];\n   eig = Table[MatrixRank[{b, b . B1}] == 1 && MatrixRank[{b, b . B2}] == 1, {b, MM}];\n   {MatrixRank[MM], Count[eig, True], Normal[B1 . B2 - B2 . B1] == ConstantArray[0, {256, 256}]}];\nbRows = {{\"(i) generic θ = (2/7, −3/5, 8/11, −11/8), u_A = θ_A − h\", Sequence @@ bTest[{2/7, -3/5, 8/11, -11/8}, -hh]},\n   {\"(ii) θ_A = θ_F + 2h, u_A = θ_A − 3h\", Sequence @@ bTest[{-3/5 + 2 hh, -3/5, -11/8 + 2 hh, -11/8}, -3 hh]},\n   {\"(iii) θ_A = θ_F + 2h, u_A = θ_A + 2h\", Sequence @@ bTest[{-3/5 + 2 hh, -3/5, -11/8 + 2 hh, -11/8}, 2 hh]}};\nGrid[Prepend[bRows, {\"case\", \"rank of words\", \"# words that are B(u)-eigenbras (of 256, exact)\", \"[B(u), B(v)] = 0\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"90\" data-out-n=\"880\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"20\" data-sub-start=\"16\" data-sub-end=\"16\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[880]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.84em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">case</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(i) generic </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\"> = (2/7, −3/5, 8/11, −11/8), u_A = </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">_A − h</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;